ble-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the W5 blog update for forms and auspices dropped: <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/news/werewolf-the-apocalypse-auspices-and-forms\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.worldofdarkness.com/news...ices-and-forms</a><br /> The only thing that stands out for me?<br /> <br /> &quot;The<i> lupus</i> form is that of a regular-sized wolf. Indeed, it might easily be mistaken for a German Shepherd or other common dog in certain areas (particularly where wolves are infrequent visitors\u2026). &quot;<br /> <br /> Someone did not do research XD</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, thats just dumb.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-25T07:31:00-07:00","id":1495566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1495560-w5-auspices-and-forms#post1495560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the W5 blog update for forms and auspices dropped: <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/news/werewolf-the-apocalypse-auspices-and-forms\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.worldofdarkness.com/news...ices-and-forms</a><br /> The only thing that stands out for me?<br /> <br /> &quot;The<i> lupus</i> form is that of a regular-sized wolf. Indeed, it might easily be mistaken for a German Shepherd or other common dog in certain areas (particularly where wolves are infrequent visitors\u2026). &quot;<br /> <br /> Someone did not do research XD</div> </div> </div> </div>I live in the middle of nothing on the eastern alps.<br /> I deal with wolves every winter, they periodically slaughter mountain goat and deers right in front of my house. I almost lost my dog more than one time, and it is huge. Saying that they did not research it's kinda kind, gentle, and reductive.<br /> Their statement is embarrassing and extremely dumb. <br /> <br /> A 40kg wolf with winter fur , its 40 kg of muscle and good fat, that looks like 60 and more kg, in an elegant and long body, that makes it even bigger.<br /> <br /> I'm not asking developers to see a true wolf in real life, but maybe take a look to a fucking german shepherd , actually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 10-25-2022, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-25T07:34:30-07:00","id":1495567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted b